  \NetworkUX\SystemSettings_Connections_MobileBroadband_ESim_AddProfileRetrievingErrorText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kāore i taea e mātou te tikiake tētahi, ētahi kōtaha rānei. Me ngana anō ā muri ake, whakapā atu rānei ki tō kaiwhakarato waea pūkoro.
