    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kua puta he raruraru
  \NetworkUX\SystemSettings_Connections_MobileBroadband_ESim_AddProfileErrorTextTimeout:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: I pau te wā mō tēnei. Tēnā kia ngana ki te whakamātau anō.
  \NetworkUX\SystemSettings_Connections_MobileBroadband_ESim_AddProfileErrorTextServerUnreachable:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kāore i taea e mātou te toro atu ki te tūmau mō tō kaiwhakarato pūkoro. Āta titiro ki tō hononga Ipurangi ka ngana anō ai.
  \NetworkUX\SystemSettings_Connections_MobileBroadband_ESim_AddProfileErrorTextServerNotTrusted:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Rawa e oti i a mātou tēnei kōtaha te tikiake nā te kore hono a te tūmau ki tētahi pūtake whirinaki. Whakapā atu ki tō kaiwhakahaere nekeneke.
  \NetworkUX\SystemSettings_Connections_MobileBroadband_ESim_AddProfileErrorTextServerGenericFailure:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kāore i taea e mātou ngā kōtaha te tiki ake nā te mea i puta mai he rarunga tūmau. Kia ngana anō ā taihoa, me whakapā atu rānei ki tō kaiwhakahaere pūkoro.
  \NetworkUX\SystemSettings_Connections_MobileBroadband_ESim_AddProfileErrorTextProfileProcessingError:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Rawa e oti i a mātou tēnei kōtaha te tāpiri nā te mea he raru i puta i te tāutanga. Whakapā atu ki tō kaiwhakahaere nekeneke.
  \NetworkUX\SystemSettings_Connections_MobileBroadband_ESim_AddProfileErrorTextProfileNotReleasedByOperator:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kāore anō kia taea tēnei kōtaha te tiki ake. Kia ngana anō ā taihoa, me whakapā atu rānei ki tō kaiwhakahaere pūkoro.
  \NetworkUX\SystemSettings_Connections_MobileBroadband_ESim_AddProfileErrorTextProfileNotAvailableForNewBinding:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kua pāhono kē tēnei kōtaha ki tētahi atu pūrere. Āta titiro kei te whai mana te waehere whakahohe, whakapā atu rānei ki tō kaiwhakahaere pūkoro.
  \NetworkUX\SystemSettings_Connections_MobileBroadband_ESim_AddProfileErrorTextProfileDownloadMaxRetriesExceeded:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Rawa e oti i a mātou tēnei kōtaha te tāpiri nā te kaha tikiake i a ia. Whakapā atu ki tō kaiwhakahaere nekeneke.
  \NetworkUX\SystemSettings_Connections_MobileBroadband_ESim_AddProfileErrorTextNoEligibleProfile:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kāore i kitea e mātou he kōtaha e hohotahi ana ki tō pūrere. Whakapā atu ki tō kaiwhakahaere pūkoro.
  \NetworkUX\SystemSettings_Connections_MobileBroadband_ESim_AddProfileErrorTextInvalidMatchingId:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kāore te TT taurite mai i te waehere whakahohe i te haere. Āta titiro kei te whai mana te waehere whakahohe, whakapā atu rānei ki tō kaiwhakahaere pūkoro.
  \NetworkUX\SystemSettings_Connections_MobileBroadband_ESim_AddProfileErrorTextIccidAlreadyExists:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Rawa e oti i a mātou tēnei kōtaha te tāpiri nā te mea he kōtaha anō me te tautuhi ōrite ki tō eSIM. Whakapā atu ki tō kaiwhakahaere nekeneke.
  \NetworkUX\SystemSettings_Connections_MobileBroadband_ESim_AddProfileErrorTextEidMismatched:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kāore te TTH eSIM i te taurite ki tērā i te kōtaha. Tēnā whakapā atu ki tō kaiwhakahaere pūkoro.
  \NetworkUX\SystemSettings_Connections_MobileBroadband_ESim_AddProfileErrorTextConfirmationCodeMaxRetriesExceeded:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: He maha rawa ngā tāurutanga o te waehere hē. Whakapā atu ki tō kaiwhakahaere pūkoro.
  \NetworkUX\SystemSettings_Connections_MobileBroadband_ESim_AddProfileErrorTextConfirmationCodeIncorrect:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kāore i te tika te waehere whakaū. Tēnā kia ngana anō.
  \NetworkUX\SystemSettings_Connections_MobileBroadband_ESim_AddProfileErrorTextCardNoSpace:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kāore i taea e mātou tēnei kōtaha te tāpiri nā te mea kāore i te tino nui te mokowa i te kāri.
  \NetworkUX\SystemSettings_Connections_MobileBroadband_ESim_AddProfileErrorTextCardGenericFailure:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kāore i taea e mātou ngā kōtaha te tiki ake, te tāuta rānei ki te eSIM. Kia ngana anō ā taihoa, me whakapā atu rānei ki tō kaiwhakahaere pūkoro.
