  \DevicesFlowUI\Resources\UnpairedDeviceDiscoveryWirelessDisplayNoRadioInstr2\Content:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Me whakarite kei te tautoko tō pūrere Windows i te Miracast, tāmau ahokore rānei, ka manatoko kua tāutatia ngā pūmanawa mārō hōu rawa mō tō whakaaturanga ahokore, whāurutau, tāmau rānei. Rapu tautoko mō ngā mōhiohio tautoko kei te paetukutuku kaiwhakanao, rapua rānei te Microsoft Store mō tō taupānga kaiwhakanao hei āwhina i a koe.
